motions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":5,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":4,"sort":3},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":3,"sort":2},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":2,"sort":1},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":2,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":2,"sort":9},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6b04f5b1beecf50d3847f9f7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795487153596,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:25:53","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f5abbeecf50d3847f9f4","chatId":"70a6c501854c4829b2bba26b868e27ca","sessionId":null,"userId":130691,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"One text, and if it comes back useless again you've lost nothing — you're still on the announcement plan, which doesn't depend on him.\n\nWorth noticing where you landed: this morning it was a bucket winning over your reputation, and now it's a logistics note, a text, and a ten-minute step-out. The Thursday thing got smaller once you said the sentence out loud.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"One text, and if it comes back useless again you've lost nothing — you're still on the announcement plan, which doesn't depend on him.\n\nWorth noticing where you landed: this morning it was a bucket winning over your reputation, and now it's a logistics note, a text, and a ten-minute step-out. The Thursday thing got smaller once you said the sentence out loud.","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1304,"promptTokens":1322,"completionTokens":143,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:25:47"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":29,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"605b57e154344daba133896ef9e6d471","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":1.7952589422766773E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b04f5abbeecf50d3847f9f3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795487147246,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:25:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f5abbeecf50d3847f9f3","chatId":"70a6c501854c4829b2bba26b868e27ca","sessionId":null,"userId":130691,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"He answers. Just with nothing useful in it. I'll ask him for the plumber's number Thursday morning anyway, costs me one text","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":28,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"605b57e154344daba133896ef9e6d471","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":1.7952589422766773E-4,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":5,"sort":4},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":3,"sort":2},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":1,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":1,"sort":9},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":0,"sort":6}],"relationId":"6b04f5abbeecf50d3847f9f4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795487147243,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:25:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f5a7beecf50d3847f9ee","chatId":"70a6c501854c4829b2bba26b868e27ca","sessionId":null,"userId":130691,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"So the only channel is a landlord who’s already been vague — that makes “get an ETA” harder than it sounded. You can’t text the plumber, so the ask has to go through him.\n\nThe cheapest version: Thursday morning, one message to the landlord — “Can you send me the plumber’s number, or have him ring me 20 minutes before he heads over?” That’s not asking the landlord to commit to a time, just to pass a message. Some landlords will do that even when they won’t pin down a window.\n\nIf he won’t even do that, then the announcement is doing all the work, and you’re back to reactive — but at least the room knows why you’re stepping out.\n\nIs the landlord the type who answers texts same-day, or does he go quiet?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"So the only channel is a landlord who’s already been vague — that makes “get an ETA” harder than it sounded. You can’t text the plumber, so the ask has to go through him.\n\nThe cheapest version: Thursday morning, one message to the landlord — “Can you send me the plumber’s number, or have him ring me 20 minutes before he heads over?” That’s not asking the landlord to commit to a time, just to pass a message. Some landlords will do that even when they won’t pin down a window.\n\nIf he won’t even do that, then the announcement is doing all the work, and you’re back to reactive — but at least the room knows why you’re stepping out.\n\nIs the landlord the type who answers texts same-day, or does he go quiet?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3206,"promptTokens":1116,"completionTokens":402,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:25:43"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":27,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"f84af0c225fc45428dd948c59256d53f","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":1.5843352583118202E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b04f5a7beecf50d3847f9ed","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795487143939,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:25:43","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f5a7beecf50d3847f9ed","chatId":"70a6c501854c4829b2bba26b868e27ca","sessionId":null,"userId":130691,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"I don't have the plumber's number. All I've got is the landlord, and he's the one who won't commit to anything","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":26,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"f84af0c225fc45428dd948c59256d53f","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":1.5843352583118202E-4,"emotions":[{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":3,"sort":7},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6b04f5a7beecf50d3847f9ee","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795487143936,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:25:43","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f5a2beecf50d3847f9e9","chatId":"70a6c501854c4829b2bba26b868e27ca","sessionId":null,"userId":130691,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That’s the loose end, then — “sometime Thursday afternoon” can land right on top of the review, and no time means you can’t plan around it, only react.\n\nTwo things that might tighten it without much cost:\n\n- Text him midday for an ETA, or ask him to ring you 20 minutes out. Then you’re not camping on the phone, you’re just waiting for a known signal.\n- Tell the juniors to park any end-of-review questions if you’re out, so the Q&A doesn’t evaporate while you’re downstairs with a bucket.\n\nIf he won’t give even that, the announcement still does its job — you step out when he calls. But I’d try to get one small commitment out of him first. Is he the type who’d text you, or is that a dead end?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That’s the loose end, then — “sometime Thursday afternoon” can land right on top of the review, and no time means you can’t plan around it, only react.\n\nTwo things that might tighten it without much cost:\n\n- Text him midday for an ETA, or ask him to ring you 20 minutes out. Then you’re not camping on the phone, you’re just waiting for a known signal.\n- Tell the juniors to park any end-of-review questions if you’re out, so the Q&A doesn’t evaporate while you’re downstairs with a bucket.\n\nIf he won’t give even that, the announcement still does its job — you step out when he calls. But I’d try to get one small commitment out of him first. Is he the type who’d text you, or is that a dead end?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":4937,"promptTokens":902,"completionTokens":528,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:25:38"}],"imgs":null,"regenera